            "author": "filip.dupanovic@gmail.com",
            "package": "screeps-webpack-plugin",
            "commit": "2769ca1b5b164f52686831d68276b722064fcb86",
            "comment": "Require webpack 5 and Node.js 24. Replace the `screeps-webpack-plugin-*` events with hooks from `ScreepsWebpackPlugin.getHooks(compilation)`, removing the `COLLECT_MODULES`, `CONFIG_CLIENT`, `BEFORE_COMMIT` and `AFTER_COMMIT` constants. Plugins listed ahead of this one get the client and the collected modules. Ship type declarations."
          },
